WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.078
Proving curvature bounds memorization would license
the cheap proxy over the expensive score.

00:00:06.158 --> 00:00:08.661
Because memorization is a privacy risk,

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:13.892
linking differential privacy to curvature explains
why privacy reduces leakage.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:19.455
Unlike influence functions, which assume Hessian
convexity that fails for deep nets,

00:00:19.535 --> 00:00:22.170
this framework needs no such assumptions.
